      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am also having this issue and it happens intermittently in west coast instances only. (To clarify, I am on the West Coast so it should be the best region for me to be in instances.)\n\nI have attempted to adjust my router, wifi, network settings, and more and nothing but not being in a west server instance fixes this voice issue.\n\nThis has been happening since around the 1-2 weeks intermittently. Idk if helps but I am also on Comcast fiber gigabit download and upload internet.\n\nMy fps is great, I don't have lag, all world audio or video is operating as expected, and more except for the voices of other players. This issue is happening also on other computers in the household and on desktop mode or vr mode.\n\nI have also had this problem before but it was caught and fixed rather quickly in the past.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
